* Female;
* Thyroid surgery should be performed under general anesthesia (GA) at an appropriate time;
* ASA grade I-III;
* Aged 18-65 years;
* BMI less than 35Kg/m2
* In line with ethics, patients voluntarily accept this experiment and sign informed consent.

